From 9c152db0e66609284821268338f5caf8bebccf5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:10:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Test and document the sparse direct solvers of oneMKL

MKLSolversTest (sequential, parallel, and on a GPU when the tests on the
GPU are enabled) solves the Laplace equation with the non symmetric,
symmetric indefinite and symmetric positive definite types, reuses the
analysis for an operator of the same pattern, computes it again for an
operator of another size or pattern, and reports an inconsistent singular
system. The generic test runs the entries of oneMKL when hypre computes on
a GPU. The configuration of Doxygen documents the module.
